  "notes": "Patient-facing PHR summary. Distinctive two-tone teal chrome: a deep navy-teal sidebar (#09384e) with a lighter active pill (#07455f), and a brighter teal (#006183) title bar holding an all-caps 'SUMMARY'. Content panels are thin-outlined, 8px-radius white boxes with bold headings and chevrons, and each collapses on its own. Lists are plain name + date pairs with no icons. The lab table uses tiny light-blue sparkline buttons (#e2f5fa) that expand into a full line chart with a shaded normal-range band, plus 'unpin' bookmark-slash icons. The Edit Layout modal (seen only on the live page) lets the user drag-reorder and hide/show dashboard sections. A demo-mode welcome toast appears top right and auto-dismisses. The page scrolls inside the content panel."
